{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flute of Gobelin</strong> is a reverse bullet hell where you take on the role of a legendary flutist, able to hypnotize goblins to fight by your side. Recruit your own squad of goblins and face endless waves of humans trying to capture you and your allies. With each level, recruit a new goblin with unique abilities.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 Different Goblins</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Builds</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Synergies and Combos</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 Different Stages</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>11 Unique Achievements</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive for 20 minutes and defeat the bosses to secure your victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to overcome this challenge?<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014630/extras/dfb0964cd5537baefa803cf31fe083ee.poster.avif?t=1758134751\" width=800 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014630/extras/dfb0964cd5537baefa803cf31fe083ee.webm?t=1758134751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014630/extras/dfb0964cd5537baefa803cf31fe083ee.mp4?t=1758134751\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4014630?t=1758134751","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4014630?t=1758134751","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014630/8f83e9895c254875cae0dbdc31cb0045de5575a4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758134751","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamsta